{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00801","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 象功舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 象功舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天地合德，睿圣昭彰。\n累赠太傅，俄登魏王。\n雄名不朽，奕叶而光。\n建国之兆，君临万方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}